  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material describing the event",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text_chunk 'a fiery blasts rocks the world trade center after being hit by two planes' as the primary interpretive lens for the visual scene. The text acts as a direct label for the visual material, forcing the user to interpret the image through this specific narrative frame, even though the text contains a grammatical error. The projection is not deictic (e.g., 'you', 'me') but semantic, where the user's understanding is anchored to the textual description overlaying the visual scene.",
